📖 Surah 113 (Surah Al-Falaq) 

(Sahih Bukhari & Sahih Muslim )

---

 1. Sone se pehle Surah Falaq parhna

Hadith :
Hazrat Aisha (RA) farmati hain:

“Jab Nabi ﷺ sone ke liye bistar par jate, to apne dono hathon par phoonk marte, 
phir **Qul Huwa Allahu Ahad**, **Qul A‘udhu bi Rabbil Falaq**, aur **Qul A‘udhu bi Rabbin Nas** parhte, phir apne jism par jahan tak haath pohanchta phairte. Yeh amal teen martaba karte.”

Reference:
Sahih al-Bukhari 5017
Sahih Muslim 2192

#Samajh 

* Surah Falaq **har qisam ki burai se panah** ke liye hai
* Nazar, jadoo, hasad, andheri raat ki burai — sab se protection

---

2. Jadoo se hifazat (Ruqyah)

Hadith :

Hazrat Aisha (RA) farmati hain:

“Jab Rasulullah ﷺ bemar hue, to aap ﷺ apne upar **Mu‘awwidhat** (Surah Falaq aur Surah Nas) parhte aur phoonk marte. Jab bemari zyada ho gayi, to main un par parhti aur unka haath unke jism par pherti.”

Reference:
Sahih al-Bukhari 5735
Sahih Muslim 2192

# Samajh

* Surah Falaq **jadoo aur hasad** se protection deti hai
* Sunnah: khud par parh kar phoonk marna
* Yeh **ruqyah** ka part hai

---

3. Surah Falaq ki khas fazilat

Hadith 
Uqbah bin Amir (RA) se riwayat hai ke Nabi ﷺ ne farmaya:

“Aaj raat aisi ayatein nazil hui hain jin ki misaal nahi dekhi gayi:
‘Qul A‘udhu bi Rabbil Falaq’ aur ‘Qul A‘udhu bi Rabbin Nas’.”

Reference:
Sahih Muslim 814

# Samajh

* Surah Falaq aur Surah Nas **sab se powerful protection surah** hain
* Yeh insaan ko **hasad, jadoo, andhera aur sharr** se bachati hain

---

# 🌿 Surah Falaq ka Main Message

Surah 113 mein hum Allah se panah mangte hain:

1. Makhlooq ki burai se
2. Andheri raat ki burai se
3. Jadoo karne walon se
4. Hasad karne wale se

---

 ✅ Sunnah Amal

Roz parhein:

* Subah 3 martaba
* Shaam 3 martaba
* Sone se pehle 3 martaba
